      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_02",
      "hash64": "83CD33680E21D883",
      "text": "Durante este curso, vuestro conocimiento se ha\\nreforzado de una manera increíble...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_03",
      "hash64": "83CD32680E21D6D0",
      "text": "¡Tanto que creo que ya no me queda nada que\\nenseñaros![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_04",
      "hash64": "83CD39680E21E2B5",
      "text": "¡Lo digo de verdad! Ahora lo que tenéis que\\nhacer es seguir mejorando por vuestra cuenta.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_05",
      "hash64": "83CD38680E21E102",
      "text": "Por ejemplo, a través de los combates en\\nconexión... ¡Venga, os los voy a explicar![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_06",
      "hash64": "83CD37680E21DF4F",
      "text": "Cuando tengáis un grupo de solo dos personas,\\nestarán disponibles las modalidades de\\r\\nCombate Individual o de Combate Doble.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_07",
      "hash64": "83CD36680E21DD9C",
      "text": "Pero si conseguís reunir a cuatro amigos, ¡podréis\\nparticipar también en Combates Múltiples![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_08",
      "hash64": "83CD3D680E21E981",
      "text": "Ahora, como todos sabéis, durante el proyecto\\nextracurricular, podéis combatir con cuantos\\r\\nPokémon queráis y de cualquier nivel.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_09",
      "hash64": "83CD3C680E21E7CE",
      "text": "Sin embargo, en los combates en conexión\\nexisten ciertas reglas que hay que seguir.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_10",
      "hash64": "83C9AF680E1EC260",
      "text": "Una de ellas es el ajuste de los niveles.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_11",
      "hash64": "83C9B0680E1EC413",
      "text": "Con el [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]reglamento sin restricciones[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], los niveles\\nde los Pokémon no se ajustarán y podréis utilizar\\r\\nPokémon de la misma especie y que lleven el\\r\\nmismo objeto.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
