        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_13",
      "hash64": "83C9B2680E1EC779",
      "text": "¡Como lo oís! Incluso los Pokémon de nivel bajo\\nse fortalecerán de repente para participar.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_14",
      "hash64": "83C9B3680E1EC92C",
      "text": "Por cierto, con este reglamento también podréis\\nusar varios Pokémon de la misma especie y que\\r\\nlleven el mismo objeto.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 120,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_15",
      "hash64": "83C9B4680E1ECADF",
      "text": "La ventaja del reglamento normal es que le quita\\nimportancia al nivel de los Pokémon.\\c\\n¡Solo necesitan conocer los movimientos\\nadecuados![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_16",
      "hash64": "83C9B5680E1ECC92",
      "text": "Por último, tenemos el [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]reglamento con[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]restricciones[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nCon él, el nivel de los Pokémon se reducirá\\na 50 en caso de que lo sobrepasen.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
