        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_17",
      "hash64": "83C9B6680E1ECE45",
      "text": "Este reglamento es el que da más pie a elaborar\\nestrategias de mayor complejidad.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_18",
      "hash64": "83C9B7680E1ECFF8",
      "text": "En él, además, se prohíbe el uso de especies de\\nPokémon u objetos idénticos.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_19",
      "hash64": "83C9B8680E1ED1AB",
      "text": "Entiendo que es mucha información, así que\\nquiero asegurarme de que todo está claro...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_20",
      "hash64": "83D3C1680E27357B",
      "text": "A ver, contestadme a esto: pongamos que quiero\\nluchar con un Pokémon de nivel bajo aposta...\\r\\n¿Qué reglamento debo elegir en ese caso?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_07_select_01",
      "hash64": "5943CF91EAF83CD0",
      "text": "Reglamento normal",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_07_select_02",
      "hash64": "5943D291EAF841E9",
      "text": "Reglamento con restricciones",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "1F260AB5952803D7",
      "text": "¡Respuesta incorrecta! Recuerda que, bajo el\\nreglamento normal, el nivel de todos los\\r\\nPokémon se ajustará a Nv. 50.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "1F260BB59528058A",
      "text": "Cómo me alegra que siempre me prestes tanta\\natención, novatill[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_21",
      "hash64": "83D3C0680E2733C8",
      "text": "Si, por alguna razón estratégica, queréis tener\\nPokémon de Nv. 5 en vuestro equipo, deberéis\\r\\nelegir el reglamento con restricciones.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_22",
      "hash64": "83D3C3680E2738E1",
      "text": "Por supuesto, también podéis elegir combatir sin\\nrestricciones si lo que queréis es poder escoger a\\r\\ncualquier Pokémon, independientemente de su\\r\\nnivel o del objeto que lleve.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 146,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_e_07_battle_23",
      "hash64": "83D3C2680E27372E",
      "text": "La verdad es que es el reglamento ideal para\\ncombatir libremente contra amigos.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
